        "text": "Yes, several parents raised concerns about homework volume."
      },
      {
        "character_id": "char_a",
        "text": "I understand. We should adjust our policy accordingly."
      },
      {
        "character_id": "char_b",
        "text": "I have drafted a new homework schedule for your review."
      },
      {
        "character_id": "char_a",
        "text": "Thank you. I will review it and reply by Wednesday."
      },
      {
        "character_id": "char_b",
        "text": "Furthermore, the principal has asked for a formal report."
      },
      {
        "character_id": "char_a",
        "text": "I will prepare the report and submit it by Friday."
      },
      {
        "character_id": "char_b",
        "text": "If we address the concerns early, we can avoid bigger issues."
      }
    ]
